00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.790
This is the Library, your place to keep your books and files.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:09.580
Add a book: open a file, or paste text.

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:12.140
It's read on your device, never uploaded.

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:16.370
Sort them into folders with a name and a colour.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.840
And reopen any book, right where you left off.

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:24.830
All of it, private, on your device.
